e or contradict one another?#{1}":[18,19],"#Historians Toolkit Lecture 5 Prep##On the basis of this week's readings, how far do you think the Indian Rebellion led people in Britain to question empire?":[20,20]},"outlinks":[]},"smart_blocks:Historian's Toolkit - Semester 1/Historians Toolkit Lecture 5 Prep.md#Historians Toolkit Lecture 5 Prep": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.05373497,0.01794214,0.0708753,0.0184868,-0.00268054,-0.04494268,-0.00335351,-0.01369769,-0.03019616,-0.03348537,0.03472137,-0.04754236,0.00950822,0.03227003,0.02273628,-0.0178716,-0.05521895,0.02026659,-0.00661252,0.02730514,0.0373888,-0.06763764,0.00567681,-0.02291338,0.05723375,-0.00034537,0.01509963,-0.04692727,-0.00315061,-0.23774764,-0.03948054,-0.04021424,0.03963614,0.00678473,0.01394204,-0.00582321,-0.00177428,0.0562074,-0.02373965,0.02844022,-0.04390661,0.04495969,0.0396868,0.01169373,-0.05173421,-0.03177233,0.01876988,-0.06332923,-0.07857601,-0.028413,-0.02936784,-0.00040479,-0.01595543,-0.03221298,0.02141216,0.03193635,0.06386843,0.0801601,0.0687326,-0.00254305,-0.00726439,0.03493217,-0.23507077,0.12074114,0.03363768,0.03544995,-0.00928821,0.04359787,0.00036051,0.03444412,-0.05782569,0.02622291,0.00619247,-0.02629243,-0.01477298,0.00931171,0.0158164,0.00191929,-0.03954498,-0.0149542,0.07792987,0.08120399,0.03076415,-0.03632238,0.01412927,-0.10026864,-0.00123248,-0.05507926,0.00681223,0.02687201,0.00981364,-0.07313759,0.06038636,0.00342866,0.04666935,0.02321722,-0.0047606,0.02659459,-0.00403232,0.09634866,-0.01951837,0.05962288,0.02396683,0.06734566,0.05660147,-0.07410013,-0.05206629,-0.03243966,0.0064431,-0.0437499,-0.00353264,-0.02746861,-0.00544246,0.03704753,-0.00213546,-0.04500242,0.11527418,-0.01367084,-0.00696134,-0.00861412,-0.00881484,-0.00106257,0.04376142,-0.03600704,-0.00216833,-0.01213917,0.01651645,0.0332562,0.01771853,-0.09967861,-0.00638915,-0.02524465,-0.06409604,-0.03668348,0.02551321,0.00859439,0.03787704,-0.02904174,0.05191406,0.0018905,